[D Quests for Zul'Farrak \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 45-48 Zul Farrak]
[NX 48-51 Alcaz Prison]

The entrance is in north-west Tanaris, at the gate of the troll city. Most quests need level 40; Mazu'kon's needs level 42 and Archmage Lan'dalock's level 39.

-- Left out: 2861 Tabetha's Task (optional breadcrumb, mage trainers only), 2864 Tran'rek (optional breadcrumb from Krazek; if it is in your log, turn it in to Tran'rek before you accept Scarab Shells), 2769 The Brassbolts Brothers (optional breadcrumb), 82084 A Lesson in Literacy (Mage class quest from the Library). Follow-ups after the dungeon: 2937/2938 (Horde), 2992-2994 (Alliance) and 4787 The Ancient Egg (Sunken Temple guide).

