Inside Zul'Farrak:
[OC]Loot Uncracked Scarab Shells from the scarabs [QC2865 Scarab Shells]
[OC]Loot Troll Temper from the Sandfury trolls [QC3042 Troll Temper]
Kill Theka the Martyr for the First Mosh'aru Tablet [QC3527,1 The Prophecy of Mosh'aru]
[A Horde] Click the Tablet of Theka in Theka's area [QC2936 The Spider God]
Kill Hydromancer Velratha for the Second Mosh'aru Tablet [QC3527,2 The Prophecy of Mosh'aru] and the Tiara of the Deep [QC2846 Tiara of the Deep]
Use the Mallet of Zul'Farrak on the gong at Gahz'rilla's pool, kill Gahz'rilla and loot Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale [QC2770 Gahz'rilla]
Sergeant Bly drops the Divino-matic Rod after the stair event [QC2768 Divino-matic Rod]
[A Horde] Kill Witch Doctor Zum'rah and loot his head [QC96775 Zum'rah's Head]
[A Alliance] Kill Witch Doctor Zum'rah and loot his head [QC96770 The Witch Doctor's Head]
[A Alliance] Kill Chief Ukorz Sandscalp and Ruuzlu and loot Nekrum's Medallion from Nekrum Gutchewer [QC2991 Nekrum's Medallion]

